      "unit_index": 2,
      "source_text": "亲友尽凋零。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "All my dear friends have withered away.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p05421",
      "unit_index": 3,
      "source_text": "苍松虽长寿，亦已非故人。”",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Though the green pine lives long, it is no longer the companion I once knew.\"",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
